flowchart TD
    H[NOAA and GHCN native captures] --> B[Historical Bronze JSON]
    B --> V[Validation and historical transaction]
    V --> S[Registered Silver Parquet snapshots]
    V --> Q[rejected_record quarantine]
    S --> G[Local PySpark reviewed consolidation]
    G --> GOV[Governance Parquet]
    G --> STORY[Storytelling Parquet]
    N[NWS Alerts and KOKC observations] --> CLI[Explicit ingestion CLI]
    A[Airflow incremental DAG] --> CLI
    CLI --> RAW[Immutable raw GeoJSON and receipts]
    RAW --> P[Transactional normalization and change detection]
    P --> DB[PostGIS records revisions sightings]
    P --> R[incremental_reject quarantine]
    P --> STATE[Commit-safe per-source scope state]
    DB --> E[Versioned unconfirmed candidate links]
    DB --> VIEW[Operational integrated view]
    GOV -. Future .-> DASH[Dashboard and CHI]
    STORY -. Future .-> DASH
    VIEW -. Project contract consumer .-> DASH
